description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Ice Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Ice;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Ice Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, chases Ice abilities with 10 single-target Ice/NE physical attacks (max 5 chases)] to user

